diff --git a/.changeset/persistent-contextual-workspace.md b/.changeset/persistent-contextual-workspace.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..eda7206
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.changeset/persistent-contextual-workspace.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+'@kumwe/studio': minor
+---
+
+Keep a single rendered canvas and command session mounted while Model, Blueprint, and Content controls move through the contextual inspector. Expose a guarded Entry-value adapter so bound content edits retain their source, retain narrow-screen sheet state, and constrain workspace height in inline and fullscreen presentations. Local contextual commands now honor the resolved mode subset as well as read-only state. Retain public browser screenshots with CI reports for visual review.
